	[6622] = {-1, 35, "Triage", 2, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, {129, 225}, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, {1, 100}, "Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries. Remember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged."},
