	[10641] = {70, 68, "Against the Legion", nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, {10640, 10689}, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, {70, 12650}, "Altruis the Sufferer wants you to obtain Freshly Drawn Blood from a Wrath Priestess at Forge Base: Gehenna in Netherstorm. Spill it on the ground and slay the Avatar of Sathal. Return to Altruis when you've completed this task."},
