	[11652] = {71, 68, "The Plains of Nasam", 2, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, {11651}, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, nil, {71, 30150}, "Use the Horde Siege Tank to destroy 100 Scourge Soldiers and rescue 3 Injured Warsong Soldiers on the Plains of Nasam. You must also discover the identity of the leader of the Scourge assault. Report to Garrosh Hellscream at Warsong Hold should you succeed.", {1085, 500}},
